---
---

<section class="bg-white py-24 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">

    <!-- Heading -->
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#1A0533] leading-tight">
        AI is incredible.<br />Let's be honest about what it actually does.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Two columns -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

      <!-- Left: What AI does well -->
      <div class="bg-[#F5F2EB] rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 text-sm font-bold">✓</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A0533]">What AI genuinely does well</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          {[
            ["Writes boilerplate fast", "Scaffolds files, configs, and repetitive code in seconds."],
            ["Explains concepts on demand", "Ask it anything. It gives you a decent answer instantly."],
            ["Debugs syntax errors", "Finds typos, missing brackets, and obvious mistakes quickly."],
            ["Scaffolds project structure", "Gets a project to a runnable state without much effort."],
            ["Generates first drafts", "Gives you something to react to, even if it needs rework."],
          ].map(([title, desc]) => (
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-2"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[#1A0533] font-semibold text-sm">{title}</p>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">{desc}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: What AI doesn't do -->
      <div class="bg-[#F5F2EB] rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#1A0533]/8 flex items-center justify-center text-[#1A0533]/60 text-sm font-bold">—</span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1A0533]">What AI doesn't do</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          {[
            ["Teach you why a pattern exists", "It uses useReducer when appropriate, but it won't explain when you should reach for it."],
            ["Build architectural intuition", "It makes choices. It doesn't build your judgment for making them yourself."],
            ["Push back when your approach is wrong", "It builds what you ask for. It does not challenge your design decisions."],
            ["Prepare you for code review", "A senior dev asking \"why did you do it this way?\" is a different pressure entirely."],
            ["Make you able to defend your decisions", "Understanding your own code well enough to explain it is a skill you have to build."],
          ].map(([title, desc]) => (
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-1 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#1A0533]/30 shrink-0 mt-2"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[#1A0533] font-semibold text-sm">{title}</p>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">{desc}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
